					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3606099#post-3591284</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3606099/grant-request-for-a-replacement-keyboard-because-the-caps-lo#post-3591284</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 13 Sep 2017 20:24:01 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Weryllium</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2727655</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>After they couldn't fix the keyboards, the employees resorted to finishing up the grant request on their smartphones and any unaffected computers they could find (this is why Business Case has the &quot;sent from my iPhone&quot; thing) and attempt to order new keyboards.</p> <p>A hive mind has formed inside the keyboards' wirings and it gained sapience from all the data inputted through it. Obviously, it disagrees with the plan to get new keyboards and has no option but to make its presence known.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">barely&nbsp;spoilers&nbsp;but&nbsp;whatever</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>KNOWN ISSUES reveals that the keyboard mind has completely taken over Prometheus Labs and either fired or 'eliminated' all of the employees.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
